 DemoCallbackArgs connected;F;Pick;cb;cbe;nq
⍝ Callbacks registered with an extra array - ('Event' 'Select' 'fn' extra) -
⍝ must be called the way native ⎕WC calls them (checked on 20.0): dyadically,
⍝ extra on the left, whenever fn can take a left argument - dyadic OR
⍝ ambivalent ({⍺}fn); a monadic fn gets just the event message, the extra
⍝ dropped; a niladic fn gets nothing. Each button reports in F1.OUT what its
⍝ callback actually received.
⍝
⍝ Root's events - WinIniChange here, but any of them - pass through eWS/eWG/eNQ
⍝ to native ⎕WS/⎕WG/⎕NQ, and must behave as if called from this namespace.
⍝ F1.ROOT shows the callback name bound through eWS as native ⎕WG reports it
⍝ here, and what eWG reports if that differs; a binding made inside #.EWC names
⍝ a function that does not exist. "Fire WinIniChange" then delivers the event
⍝ through a real ⎕DQ, which is what fails when the binding is wrong.
 EWC.CONNECTED←connected

 F←'F1'
 F eWC'Form' 'Callback Arguments'(50 50)(210 420)('Coord' 'Pixel')
 (F,'.DYA')eWC'Button' 'Dyadic + extra'(12 12)(24 190)('Event' 'Select' 'CBArgsDyadic' 466)
 (F,'.AMB')eWC'Button' 'Ambivalent + extra'(12 212)(24 190)('Event' 'Select' 'CBArgsAmbivalent' 466)
 (F,'.AMB0')eWC'Button' 'Ambivalent, no extra'(44 12)(24 190)('Event' 'Select' 'CBArgsAmbivalent')
 (F,'.MON')eWC'Button' 'Monadic + extra'(44 212)(24 190)('Event' 'Select' 'CBArgsMonadic' 466)
 (F,'.NIL')eWC'Button' 'Niladic + extra'(76 12)(24 190)('Event' 'Select' 'CBArgsNiladic' 466)
 (F,'.FIRE')eWC'Button' 'Fire WinIniChange'(76 212)(24 190)('Event' 'Select' 'CBArgsFireWinIni')
 (F,'.OUT')eWC'Label' 'Click a button'(114 12)(22 396)

 ⍝ The name bound to Root's WinIniChange, from an 'Event' property value
 Pick←{e←{2=|≡⍵:,⊂⍵ ⋄ ⍵}⍵ ⋄ e←('WinIniChange'∘≡¨⊃¨e)/e ⋄ 0=≢e:'unsupported' ⋄ ⍕2⊃⊃e}
 :Trap 0
     '.'eWS'Event' 'WinIniChange' 'CBArgsWinIni'
     cb←Pick'.'⎕WG'Event'               ⍝ As native reports it from here
     cbe←Pick'.'eWG'Event'              ⍝ As EWC reports it
     '.'eWS'Event' 'WinIniChange' 0     ⍝ Leave Root as we found it
 :Else
     cb←cbe←'unsupported'               ⍝ No Root WinIniChange on this platform
 :EndTrap
 (F,'.ROOT')eWC'Label'('Root WinIniChange: ',cb,(cb≢cbe)/', eWG says ',cbe)(142 12)(22 396)

 ⍝ eNQ on Root likewise: a method argument naming an object - a native Font
 ⍝ here - must be found in this namespace, as native ⎕NQ finds it
 :Trap 0
     'CBARGSFONT'⎕WC'Font' 'Arial' 60
     nq←(2 ⎕NQ'.' 'GetTextSize' 'Hello' 'CBARGSFONT')≡2 eNQ'.' 'GetTextSize' 'Hello' 'CBARGSFONT'
     nq←(1+nq)⊃'differs from native' 'same as native'
 :Else
     nq←'unsupported'
 :EndTrap
 ⎕EX'CBARGSFONT'
 (F,'.NQ')eWC'Label'('Root GetTextSize via eNQ: ',nq)(170 12)(22 396)
